infrastructure and industrial projects. Agriculture has also become part of this expanding partnership. Food systems specialist Adrino Mazenda <a href=\"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/1758-5899.70193\">analysed</a> Ch...ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Is9ojdYcCMjT8Y8Ul7r3cSXpNHSfvnsuEGbTiebxTO4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky¬Prior research (store/culture/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness.json, ni:///sha-256;hGJMeFH1gXo2qntl-NVp5p4fNB-ctAC6I1CZGGJMFjU): "force": "alleges", "provenance": { "witness": "culture", "citation": "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/09/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness" },ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;O6L9b3R_wm7I0nx9ModHAoMWc4ieKrjy7u4PvFRd1KAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky¬Prior research (store/culture/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness.json, ni:///sha-256;hGJMeFH1gXo2qntl-NVp5p4fNB-ctAC6I1CZGGJMFjU): "force": "alleges", "provenance": { "witness": "culture", "citation": "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/09/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness" },ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;DRORyiNMQO1AXcpwUVZqxIqrtOJhzO5prYSfJC7U-9Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyPrior research (store/culture/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness.json, ni:///sha-256;hGJMeFH1gXo2qntl-NVp5p4fNB-ctAC6I1CZGGJMFjU): "proposition": { "predicate": "summary", "object": "<p><strong>(Third Man)</strong><br>Following the superb No Name, White continues his fan service with stripped back songs and nasty, anarchic riffs â€“ though it all ends up feeling a little samey</p><p>Itâ€™s a strange thing to say about one of the most prolific artists of his â€“ or any â€“ generation, but: Jack White has been undergoing something of a career renaissance of late. After firmly establishing himself as one of the most beloved and defining figures of 21st-century rock with his early-00s blues duo the White Stripes, White seemed to get bigger and bigger over the next decade-plus, releasing albums with well-liked side projects the R...ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jJznVnSYpuGSe0FCKkY4Ru01BBNyuIb3KL6xobgswDwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky¬Prior research (store/culture/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness.json, ni:///sha-256;hGJMeFH1gXo2qntl-NVp5p4fNB-ctAC6I1CZGGJMFjU): "force": "alleges", "provenance": { "witness": "culture", "citation": "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/09/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness" },ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;FFvMfjOVcNrlDlj5nRAW0QFTrlb6C1shtpKBigS4Nqwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky¬Prior research (store/culture/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness.json, ni:///sha-256;hGJMeFH1gXo2qntl-NVp5p4fNB-ctAC6I1CZGGJMFjU): "force": "alleges", "provenance": { "witness": "culture", "citation": "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/09/jack-white-frozen-charlotte-review-brutal-squalid-blues-rock-that-just-about-sells-its-own-ridiculousness" },ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;X-LfgwlM165pLyL_TdFwePY9jKBnqk5z6HuNgR4QEI8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky}Prior research (store/collapse-climate/experts-why-carbon-removal-needs-a-major-scale-up-to-return-warming-to-1-5c.json, ni:///sha-256;YYpMpmYpjjcwYpbqsWp02E4T2c0Zkk6o6w3FTHQ-dyk): "proposition": { "predicate": "summary", "object": "Last week, more than 260 researchers convened in Milan to discuss the opportunities, challenges and risks involved in scaling â€œcarbon dioxide removalâ€ (CDR) to help curb climate change. The conference â€“ held on the campus of the Politecnico di Milano â€“ is the fourth in a series, with previous editions held in Oxford, UK in 2024 , and Gothenburg, Sweden in 2018 and 2022.&nbsp; A broad range of academics â€“ from forests, oceans and soils experts through to social and political scientists â€“ discussed the co-benefits and trade-offs involved in drawing down CO2 from the atmosphere at scale, as well as the ways policy could drive CDR deployment...ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;hqQxyXy461xiwjXRRj2d7diEOSthhCIAAeoV25CK0Ikƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyIPrior research (store/collapse-decolonization/art-as-a-force-of-resistance.json, ni:///sha-256;hHlW2v6aVgXEMPJpyIJQsqg_QWH39TICYPUcQYTOzT4): "proposition": { "predicate": "summary", "object": "<span>Art as a Force of Resistance</span> <span><span>tia.roberts</span></span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-06-16T15:49:18-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 16, 2026 - 15:49\">Tue, 06/16/2026 - 15:49</time> </span> <div class=\"field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-3 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"> <div class=\"field__label\">CSQ Issue</div> <div class=\"field__item\"><div> <h2><a href=\"https://www.culturalsurvival.org/publications/cultural-survival-quarterly/50-2-pathways-healing-indigenous-sovereignty-traditional\"> <div class=\"field field--name-name field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item\">50-2: Pathways t...ƒdpairƒhconst